==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Binacle|103}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Dual Chop}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Binacle}} can learn via [[Move Tutor]].
